{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":70849,"duration_api_ms":70747,"num_turns":3,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"394c3b66-73f2-4867-8768-54201e19e0f6","total_cost_usd":0.2934946,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22924,"cache_read_input_tokens":74443,"output_tokens":2204,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22924,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":2204,"cacheReadInputTokens":74443,"cacheCreationInputTokens":22924,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2356165,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":49,"outputTokens":3467,"cacheReadInputTokens":169141,"cacheCreationInputTokens":18864,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0578781,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"summary":"Both amendments are valid and interrelated. Amendment 1 identifies a real physics bug where the order of min-capping and ratio-multiplication destroys the CO2/O2 diffusion coefficient ratio at high aeration levels. Amendment 2 correctly identifies that the test meant to validate this ratio is a mathematical tautology that never exercises the actual CO2 K_LA code path, explaining why the bug in amendment 1 was never caught.","votes":[{"amendment_id":"fr-1-569dbe0f","decision":"accept","rationale":"Verified in code: chemistry.rs:567 computes `(k_la_o2 * 0.91).min(1.0)` while dissolved_oxygen.rs:67 independently caps `k_la.min(1.0)`. When raw k_la_o2 exceeds 1.0 (which happens at full aeration), both O2 and CO2 K_LA get capped to 1.0, making the effective ratio 1.0 instead of the physical 0.91. The compute_o2_kla docstring explicitly instructs callers to cap the returned value before use. The proposed fix `k_la_o2.min(1.0) * KLA_CO2_TO_O2_RATIO` correctly mirrors how the O2 path caps first, then preserves the diffusion coefficient ratio at all aeration levels."},{"amendment_id":"fr-1-a24ce504","decision":"accept","rationale":"Verified in code: the test at co2_exchange.rs:473-499 calls `compute_o2_kla()` and then does `let k_la_co2 = k_la_o2 * 0.91`, followed by asserting `(k_la_co2 / k_la_o2 - 0.91).abs() < 1e-10`. This is algebraically `(x * 0.91 / x - 0.91) < 1e-10`, a tautology that passes regardless of what the actual CO2 K_LA code in chemistry.rs does. The test provides zero coverage of the real code path and directly explains why the capping bug in amendment 1 was never detected. The test should be rewritten to exercise the actual `hourly_chemistry_terms` CO2 K_LA computation."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"282e8e24-1036-4266-9e92-efd9d9ae51c1"}
